+{
+  "@context": "https://schema.org",
+  "@type": "FAQPage",
+  "mainEntity": [
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "How often should I have my chimney swept?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "It's generally recommended to have your chimney swept at least once a year, especially if you use it regularly during the colder months. However, the frequency can depend on factors such as the type of fuel you burn and how often you use your fireplace or stove. Some common signs that you require a sweep include a strong smell of smoke in your home, visible soot or creosote buildup around the fireplace or stove, reduced draw, and smoke coming back into the room when you use your fireplace."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "Can I sweep my chimney myself?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "While there are DIY chimney sweeping kits available, it's generally recommended to hire a professional chimney sweep. They have the experience, tools, and knowledge to thoroughly clean your chimney and identify any potential issues that may need attention."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "Are there any safety precautions I should take before a chimney sweep arrives?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "It's a good idea to clear the area around your fireplace or stove and ensure that pets and children are kept away during the chimney sweep. And whilst I bring my own sheets and take every care to protect your property, you may also want to cover nearby furniture or flooring to protect against any falling soot or debris."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "What if the chimney sweep finds a problem during the inspection?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "If the chimney sweep identifies any issues such as cracks, blockages, or excessive creosote buildup, they will typically provide recommendations for repairs or further action. It's important to address any problems promptly to ensure the safety and efficiency of your chimney. In rare cases, a NACS Warning Notice may be issued, this warns that the chimney or appliance is not safe for use."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "Can you provide a certificate of sweeping?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "Yes, as a registered member of the National Association of Chimney Sweeps, I provide a NACS certificate for every chimney swept, after every sweep."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "What areas do you serve?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "I provide chimney sweeping services across North Wales, including Gwynedd, Conwy and Anglesey. If you're unsure please take a look at my Areas page or get in touch to confirm if I cover your specific location."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "How do I book a chimney sweep appointment?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "You can easily book your chimney sweep appointment online using my booking widget on the Booking page. Simply select your preferred date and time, and no upfront payment is required - you only pay after the service."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "What payment methods do you accept?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "I accept cash, BACS and cheques. Please contact me if you have any specific questions about payment options."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "Do you offer any additional services besides chimney sweeping?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "Yes, in addition to chimney sweeping, I also offer services such as CCTV chimney inspections, bird nest and blockage removal, stove maintenance, and more. Please visit my Services page for a full list of the services I provide."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "Are you insured?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "Yes, I am fully insured for your peace of mind. I carry public liability insurance to cover any potential damage or accidents that may occur during chimney sweeping services."
+      }
+    },
+    {
+      "@type": "Question",
+      "name": "What if I have a question that isn't answered here?",
+      "acceptedAnswer": {
+        "@type": "Answer",
+        "text": "If you have any other questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to contact me. I'm here to help!"
+      }
+    }
